---
// 下载 CTA:双平台大按钮
---

<section id="download" class="relative py-32 px-4">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="relative glass-strong overflow-hidden">
      <!-- 装饰光晕 -->
      <div class="glow-orb w-[500px] h-[500px] bg-aurora-violet/30 -top-40 -left-40 animate-pulse-glow"></div>
      <div class="glow-orb w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-aurora-cyan/25 -bottom-40 -right-40 animate-pulse-glow" style="animation-delay: 1s"></div>

      <div class="relative p-12 md:p-16 text-center">
        <div class="reveal inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 mb-6 rounded-full bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 text-xs text-white/70">
          <span class="relative flex w-1.5 h-1.5">
            <span class="absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-emerald-400 animate-ping opacity-75"></span>
            <span class="relative rounded-full w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-400"></span>
          </span>
          现在可用 · v0.1.0
        </div>

        <h2 class="reveal text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold tracking-tight mb-6">
          <span class="text-gradient">现在就装上试试</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="reveal text-white/60 max-w-lg mx-auto mb-10">
          装之前先确认本机装了
          <a href="https://www.anthropic.com/claude-code" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="text-white/90 underline decoration-white/30 hover:decoration-white/70 transition-colors">Claude Code CLI</a>
          。第一次打开会带你走一遍 3 分钟的引导。
        </p>

        <div class="reveal flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4">
          <!-- macOS -->
          <a href="#" class="group relative flex items-center gap-4 pl-5 pr-6 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-white text-ink-950 min-w-[240px] transition-transform hover:-translate-y-1"
             style="box-shadow: 0 20px 60px -10px rgba(124, 92, 255, 0.5);">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M18.71 19.5c-.83 1.24-1.71 2.45-3.05 2.47-1.34.03-1.77-.79-3.29-.79-1.53 0-2 .77-3.27.82-1.31.05-2.3-1.32-3.14-2.53C4.25 17 2.94 12.45 4.7 9.39c.87-1.52 2.43-2.48 4.12-2.51 1.28-.02 2.5.87 3.29.87.78 0 2.26-1.07 3.81-.91.65.03 2.47.26 3.64 1.98-.09.06-2.17 1.28-2.15 3.81.03 3.02 2.65 4.03 2.68 4.04-.03.07-.42 1.44-1.38 2.83M13 3.5c.73-.83 1.94-1.46 2.94-1.5.13 1.17-.34 2.35-1.04 3.19-.69.85-1.83 1.51-2.95 1.42-.15-1.15.41-2.35 1.05-3.11z"/></svg>
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest opacity-60">Download for</div>
              <div class="font-semibold">macOS · Apple Silicon</div>
            </div>
            <svg class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>

          <!-- Windows -->
          <a href="#" class="group relative flex items-center gap-4 pl-5 pr-6 py-4 rounded-2xl bg-white/[0.06] backdrop-blur-xl border border-white/10 text-white min-w-[240px] transition-all hover:-translate-y-1 hover:bg-white/[0.1] hover:border-white/20">
            <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M3 5.55L11 4.4v7.55H3zm0 12.9L11 19.6V12.05H3zM12 19.75L22 21.15V12.05H12zM12 4.25v7.7h10V2.85z"/></svg>
            <div class="text-left">
              <div class="text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest text-white/50">Download for</div>
              <div class="font-semibold">Windows · x64</div>
            </div>
            <svg class="ml-2 transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"/><polyline points="12 5 19 12 12 19"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="reveal mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-xs text-white/30">
          <span>~ 120 MB</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <span>私有测试版</span>
          <span>·</span>
          <a href="#" class="hover:text-white/60 transition-colors">macOS Intel / Linux 版本 →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
